  description: '2 EARTH Rock monsters

    Face-up monsters on the field become
    EARTH. You can only use each of the following effects of "Conduction Warrior
    Plasma Magnum" once per turn. If this card is Fusion Summoned: You can add 1
    "Magnet" Normal, Quick-Play, or Field Spell from your Deck to your hand. You
    can send 1 Level 8 "Magna Warrior" monster from your Deck to the GY; immediately
    after this effect resolves, Normal Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Magnet Warrior"
    monster.'
